:"c-shiji-066-wu:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m013-0183","start":183,"end":186,"surface":"申包胥","kind":"person","person_id":"thi_bqo_x8d","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m013-0200","start":200,"end":202,"surface":"包胥","kind":"person","person_id":"thi_bqo_x8d","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m020-0278","start":278,"end":281,"surface":"申包胥","kind":"person","person_id":"thi_bqo_x8d","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m020-0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"包胥","kind":"person","person_id":"thi_bqo_x8d","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-shiji066-010","person_id":"thi_bqo_x8d","relation":"migration_destination","place":{"source_name":"秦","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"source_term":"申包胥走秦告急","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p013","quote":"始伍員與申包胥為交，員之亡也，謂包胥曰：「我必覆楚。」包胥曰：「我必存之。」及吳兵入郢，伍子胥求昭王。既不得，乃掘楚平王墓，出其尸，鞭之三百，然後已。申包胥亡於山中，使人謂子胥曰：「子之報讎，其以甚乎！吾聞之，人眾者勝天，天定亦能破人。今子故平王之臣，親北面而事之，今至於僇死人，此豈其無天道之極乎！」伍子胥曰：「為我謝申包胥曰，吾日莫途遠，吾故倒行而逆施之。」於是申包胥走秦告急，求救於秦。秦不許。包胥立於秦廷，晝夜哭，七日七夜不絕其聲。秦哀公憐之，曰：「楚雖無道，有臣若是，可無存乎！」乃遣車五百乘救楚擊吳。六月，敗吳兵於稷。會吳王久留楚求昭王，而闔廬弟夫概乃亡歸，自立為王。闔廬聞之，乃釋楚而歸，擊其弟夫概。夫概敗走，遂奔楚。楚昭王見吳有內亂，乃復入郢。封夫概於堂谿，為堂谿氏。楚復與吳戰，敗吳，吳王乃歸。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m013-0004"}],"interpretation_note":"按本篇敘事保存原地名及人物範圍，不由同段提及推所有人物到訪；山中不定位現代行政區，未知日期不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-s